---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { YEARS_EXPERIENCE } from '../consts';
---
<Page
  title="Portfolio"
  description="Overview of my professional career as a designer, researcher, educator and design leader, in-depth case studies and highlights of various projects."
>

	<h1 class="page-name">Portfolio</h1>

  <div class="page-intro">
    <p class="lead">
      (Out-of-date) overview of my professional career as a designer, researcher, educator and design leader, in-depth case studies and highlights of various projects&mdash;all in one presentation available upon request.
    </p>
  </div>

	<div class="page-content">
    <p>I have {YEARS_EXPERIENCE} years of professional experience in designing interactions and interfaces. I work in a product design team, and previously I designed services, worked at the agency, managed digital products and was a head of design departments and teams. I always put people first, not losing the business strategy and objective out of sight.</p>
    <figure>
      <a href="https://portfolio-of-lukasz.tyra.la">
        <img src="/portfolio-contact-sheet.jpg" alt="Contact sheet presenting thumbs of slides from portfolio" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <figcaption><a href="https://f001.backblazeb2.com/file/webpub/Portfolio_of_Lukasz_Tyrala.pdf">Download Portfolio</a><br><code>PDF ✦ 65 655 289 bytes</code></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p>My <mark>current projects are not included</mark> in the portfolio. I am happy to present my more recent work upon request.</p>
    <h2>Highlights</h2>
    <p>If you just want a quick glimpse of some snapshots and highlights, below you will find examples of my work&mdash;this scratches the surface, so if you would like to know more, let me know.</p>
    <figure>
      <iframe class="embed embed--16x9" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GnJe-psrUA8" title="YouTube video player" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <figcaption>UX/UI design of a time zone picker improvements. Read companion article <a href="https://medium.com/@lukasz/on-time-time-zones-and-software-6617a4c22d05">On Time, Time Zones, and Software</a></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <iframe class="embed" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/328397590?h=9d2d0e2fd0&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen title="fropt" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <figcaption>UX/UI for a website and CRM/CMS for a furniture startup. UX strategy, defining digital MVP, and complicated offering under the hood.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
