      <figcaption>Axure prototype of a global intranet for Nutricia Amsterdam. A lot of stakeholders, workshops, and communication work to set up the new portal for success.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="narrow">
      <iframe class="embed embed--portrait" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/328405768?h=8ff6504bd5&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen title="miastologia-pl" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <figcaption>A website that allowed people to learn everything about real estate offer and purchase the apartment online&mdash;first full digital real estate sales process on Polish market.</figcaption>
